4. SYNTHETIC DATA DISCLAIMER
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Software operates exclusively on synthetic, hard-coded and entirely
fictitious data, including simulated eye-tracking signals, simulated video
stream status and simulated digital interaction traces. No real personal data,
no real learner records and no human subjects are involved. No data collection,
no sensor capture, no camera access and no biometric processing of any
identifiable person is performed or required. Any resemblance to real learners,
institutions or cases is purely coincidental.

